WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:01.126
The game is changing.

00:00:01.126 --> 00:00:03.128
I know I come with a history
that not all of you love.

00:00:03.128 --> 00:00:04.630
I'm not gonna get edged out.

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:06.006
♪♪

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.175
♪♪

00:00:08.175 --> 00:00:09.259
The game is changing 

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:13.388
my job is to ensure
the stability of UBA

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:15.891
Alex, I need you to come back.

00:00:15.891 --> 00:00:18.101
You are the only thing 
that can save us.

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:18.936
[laughs]

00:00:18.936 --> 00:00:20.562
I don't think I've ever said
that before.

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:22.898
♪♪

00:00:22.898 --> 00:00:24.233
I'm not gonna get edged out.

00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:26.652
Alex Levy.
[applause]

00:00:26.652 --> 00:00:28.278
I feel like they're
bringing in my big sister

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:29.488
to clean up my mess.

00:00:29.488 --> 00:00:30.906
Man, you couldn't have planned
this any better

00:00:30.906 --> 00:00:32.407
stepping away when you did.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.911
I was broken Doug.

00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:38.455
Yeah.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:39.498
Ratings have been down.

00:00:39.498 --> 00:00:41.375
This network needs to
clean up it's act.

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:41.917
Five.

00:00:41.917 --> 00:00:44.127
We're trying to get ahead
of this coronavirus thing.

00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:45.837
-Four.
Someone should cover it.

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:46.797
Well Bradley can do it.

00:00:46.797 --> 00:00:49.216
-Three.
Don't forget, this is your show.

00:00:49.216 --> 00:00:49.841
And we're back.

00:00:49.841 --> 00:00:51.426
-Two.
I know I come with a history

00:00:51.426 --> 00:00:52.511
that not all of you love.

00:00:52.511 --> 00:00:53.262
One.

00:00:53.262 --> 00:00:55.097
Nine months ago you opened a
door

00:00:55.097 --> 00:00:57.140
and you need to walk 
through it now.

00:00:59.393 --> 00:01:01.395
A bombshell from journalist
Maggie Brenner's

00:01:01.395 --> 00:01:03.897
upcoming exposé on behind
the scenes troubles

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:05.732
at UBA's The Morning Show.

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:09.069
There is a pattern of behavior
around here

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:11.363
that disadvantages the
people of color.

00:01:11.363 --> 00:01:12.823
We need to get our facts
straight.

00:01:12.823 --> 00:01:15.033
We need to decide
what the truth is.

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:16.910
Did you hear what you just said?

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.578
Maggie, I would like
to see the book.

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:20.455
You don't like me,
you never liked me.

00:01:20.455 --> 00:01:21.540
That's not true.

00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:23.250
Which part?

00:01:24.167 --> 00:01:25.627
Onward and upward.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.422
You were a dynamo out there.

00:01:28.422 --> 00:01:30.424
I don't think they're using you
in the right way.

00:01:30.424 --> 00:01:32.843
I don't trust her.
-She seems perfectly nice.

00:01:34.845 --> 00:01:36.096
Oh God, she bugs me.

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:40.934
♪♪

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:43.103
I'm your boss, I'm gonna
make sure it works out.

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:44.104
Oh, you're my boss.

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:45.272
I thought you were my friend.

00:01:45.272 --> 00:01:46.606
I'm on your side.

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:49.067
The network doesn't think you
have the "It" factor

00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:50.610
we're looking to showcase
some other talent.

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:52.404
You know what the problem with
racism is?

00:01:52.404 --> 00:01:54.740
You don't fix it by pretending
to want to fix it.

00:01:55.282 --> 00:01:56.867
What I want is to change things

00:01:56.867 --> 00:01:59.745
because the jury's still out
if you were successful.

00:02:00.412 --> 00:02:02.122
Happy days are here again.

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:05.292
♪♪

00:02:05.292 --> 00:02:07.377
In case you forgot,
I'm the whistleblower.

00:02:07.377 --> 00:02:09.588
I'm gonna get everything I want.

00:02:10.589 --> 00:02:12.674
You're just so caught up 
in ruling

00:02:12.674 --> 00:02:14.301
over your rotten little fiefdom

00:02:14.676 --> 00:02:16.678
the rest of the world,
they've moved to the cloud

00:02:16.678 --> 00:02:18.722
and it is gorgeous up there.

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:23.977
This is a battle for the
soul of the universe.

00:02:26.355 --> 00:02:29.816
♪♪

